---
<section aria-labelledby="academy-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-forest text-bone" id="academy"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full text-bone opacity-[0.06]" focusable="false" preserveaspectratio="xMidYMid slice" viewbox="0 0 1600 1200"><g aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"></g></svg><div class="relative px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-36"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-bone/70"><span class="tabular-nums">05</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Academy &amp; practice</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.3rem,4.6vw,4.6rem)] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em]" id="academy-heading">Practice, <em class="font-serif font-normal">measured to the millimetre.</em></h2></div><div class="self-end lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9"><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-bone/75" data-reveal="true">Every bay, green and bunker in the Academy is tracked, so practice turns into progress you can see. The technology stays out of sight. The feedback doesn't.</p><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-5" data-reveal="true"><button class="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-bone px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-charcoal transition-colors hover:bg-ochre" type="button">Book a lesson<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em]" href="/morrow/academy"><span class="relative py-1">Explore the Academy<span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-px origin-left bg-current transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:scale-x-0 group-hover:origin-right"></span></span><span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-current/30 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:border-current"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div><div class="mt-16 grid gap-10 lg:mt-24 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><ol class="lg:col-span-5"><li class="border-t border-bone/15 py-8 transition-opacity duration-500 last:border-b lg:py-12 lg:opacity-100" data-facility="true"><div class="relative mb-6 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] lg:hidden"><img alt="A golfer mid-swing in a covered range bay at dusk, with the floodlit range stretching beyond" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/images/golf-academy-range.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/50">01</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none">The Range</h3></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-md pl-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/75">Forty-eight bays, half covered and heated, with ball-flight tracking on every one. Target greens stretch 320 metres and are shaped like the course’s own.</p><ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 pl-10"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">48 tracked bays</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">320 m range</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">06:30 to 22:00</li></ul></li><li class="border-t border-bone/15 py-8 transition-opacity duration-500 last:border-b lg:py-12 lg:opacity-45 lg:hover:opacity-80" data-facility="true"><div class="relative mb-6 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] lg:hidden"><img alt="A flagstick on an immaculate green above the bay as the sun sets behind the mountains" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/images/campaign/green-at-sunset.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:82% center;color:transparent"/></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/50">02</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none">Short Game Park</h3></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-md pl-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/75">Three hectares of chipping greens, pitching areas and bunkers, built from the same sand and turf as the championship course.</p><ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 pl-10"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">3 hectares</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">7 practice greens</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">Course-matched sand</li></ul></li><li class="border-t border-bone/15 py-8 transition-opacity duration-500 last:border-b lg:py-12 lg:opacity-45 lg:hover:opacity-80" data-facility="true"><div class="relative mb-6 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] lg:hidden"><img alt="A golfer crouching to read a putt beside the flag, the bay and mountains behind" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/images/campaign/reading-the-putt.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:38% center;color:transparent"/></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/50">03</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none">Putting Lab</h3></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-md pl-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/75">An indoor studio where laser guides and a pressure-mapped green show exactly how your stroke starts the ball rolling.</p><ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 pl-10"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">Pressure-mapped green</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">Laser alignment</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">Video review</li></ul></li><li class="border-t border-bone/15 py-8 transition-opacity duration-500 last:border-b lg:py-12 lg:opacity-45 lg:hover:opacity-80" data-facility="true"><div class="relative mb-6 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] lg:hidden"><img alt="An iron resting behind a ball on dewy turf, fairways and the bay softly out of focus" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/images/campaign/iron-and-ball.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:52% center;color:transparent"/></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/50">04</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none">Performance Studio</h3></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-md pl-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/75">3D motion capture, launch monitoring and custom club fitting, with your analysis sent to your phone after every session.</p><ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 pl-10"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">3D motion capture</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">Custom fitting</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">Session reports</li></ul></li><li class="border-t border-bone/15 py-8 transition-opacity duration-500 last:border-b lg:py-12 lg:opacity-45 lg:hover:opacity-80" data-facility="true"><div class="relative mb-6 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] lg:hidden"><img alt="A wide fairway framed by bunkers and a still lake, rising toward a villa among the pines" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/images/campaign/fairway-panorama.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:58% center;color:transparent"/></div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-5"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-bone/50">05</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-none">The Short Nine</h3></div><p class="mt-4 max-w-md pl-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/75">A floodlit par-three course of nine holes from 68 to 142 yards, open until eleven at night. Built for quick rounds, first rounds and late light.</p><ul class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 pl-10"><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">9 holes</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">68 to 142 yds</li><li class="rounded-full border border-bone/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-bone/80">Floodlit until 23:00</li></ul></li></ol><div class="hidden lg:col-span-7 lg:block"><div class="sticky top-24"><div class="relative aspect-[4/5] max-h-[calc(100svh-8rem)] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] bg-pine xl:aspect-[5/6]"><div aria-hidden="false" class="absolute inset-0 transition-[opacity,transform] duration-[1400ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] scale-100 opacity-100"><img alt="A golfer mid-swing in a covered range bay at dusk, with the floodlit range stretching beyond" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="55vw" src="/images/golf-academy-range.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 transition-[opacity,transform] duration-[1400ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] scale-[1.08] opacity-0"><img alt="A flagstick on an immaculate green above the bay as the sun sets behind the mountains" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="55vw" src="/images/campaign/green-at-sunset.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:82% center;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 transition-[opacity,transform] duration-[1400ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] scale-[1.08] opacity-0"><img alt="A golfer crouching to read a putt beside the flag, the bay and mountains behind" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="55vw" src="/images/campaign/reading-the-putt.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:38% center;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 transition-[opacity,transform] duration-[1400ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] scale-[1.08] opacity-0"><img alt="An iron resting behind a ball on dewy turf, fairways and the bay softly out of focus" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="55vw" src="/images/campaign/iron-and-ball.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:52% center;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 transition-[opacity,transform] duration-[1400ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] scale-[1.08] opacity-0"><img alt="A wide fairway framed by bunkers and a still lake, rising toward a villa among the pines" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="55vw" src="/images/campaign/fairway-panorama.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:58% center;color:transparent"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pine/80 via-transparent to-pine/20"></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex justify-between p-6 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-bone/85"><span>The Academy</span><span>01<!-- --> / <!-- -->05</span></div><div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-6 animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-4 duration-700"><p class="type-wide text-3xl font-medium uppercase">The Range</p><p class="mt-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-bone/75">48 tracked bays · 320 m range · 06:30 to 22:00</p></div></div></div></div></div><dl class="mt-20 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 border-t border-bone/15 pt-10 lg:mt-28 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 max-w-[14rem] text-sm leading-snug text-bone/65">tracked bays on the range</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-none tr